{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9TcGFuaXNoLUxhbmd1YWdlL0Nocm9uaWNsZSUyME9mJTIwQW4lMjBFc2NhcGUlMjAlMjgyMDA2JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Chronicle Of An Escape","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/rjizxUO1zTNre3vOLyF6Zc9pAxf.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xc9YIOS8p3JTfTjBSNjSlLBm927.jpg","description":"The true story of four men who narrowly escaped death at the hands of Argentina's military death squads in 1977. Claudio Tamburrini is a goalie for a minor-league football team when he is abducted by members of the Argentine military police and taken to an unofficial detention center on the false suspicion that he is a terrorist. As he is tortured by intelligence agents looking for information he doesn't have, Tamburrini fully expects to be killed. After many sessions of brutal torture, Tamburrini and his fellow captives Guillermo and Tano are being readied for execution when, in a final desperate act, Tamburrini dives out a window during a rainstorm.\n\nRated R · Released 27 Apr 2006 · Argentina · Language: Spanish · 103 min\nStudio: 20th Century Fox Argentina, INCAA, K & S Films\n\nOn your server — Audio: Spanish","releaseInfo":"2006","genres":["Thriller","Others"],"imdbRating":"6.6","runtime":"103 min","cast":["Rodrigo de la Serna","Pablo Echarri","Nazareno Casero","Lautaro Delgado Tymruk","Matías Marmorato","Diego Alonso","Guillermo Fernández","César Albarracín"],"director":["Adrián Caetano"],"released":"2006-04-27T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"An Inside View of Political Detainees","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Adrián Caetano","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qsJm9IHiJqVo1w1WaOQlN7SrYJv.jpg"},{"name":"Rodrigo de la Serna","character":"Claudio Tamburrini","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yUngw2JLFYewHJq1oqx5JnNVpnW.jpg"},{"name":"Pablo Echarri","character":"Huguito","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eJSTPr8uViInEncGVK73wIk9pCI.jpg"},{"name":"